OL,3,CBurnham to publish details of all
OL,4,Cmeetings with scandal-hit Manchester
OL,5,CCity
OL,7,FAndy Burnham pledged to "put out there
OL,8,Feverything that I have done working"
OL,9,Fwith Manchester City.
OL,11,FIt follows criticism of the Prime
OL,12,FMinister's comments in the wake of the
OL,13,Fclub being found guilty of all charges
OL,14,Frelated to breaches of the Premier
OL,15,FLeague's financial rules between 2009
OL,16,Fand 2018.
OL,18,FCity insist they are innocent and will
OL,19,Fappeal against the verdict.
OL,26,@oD@YOUpD@dO]
