PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1793022500
OL,3,CBurnham to publish details of all
OL,4,Cmeetings with scandal-hit Manchester
OL,5,CCity
OL,7,FBut Burnham's support of its owners
OL,8,Fraised eyebrows.
OL,10,FSome rivals were so "astonished" by
OL,11,Fhis stance they had "concerns" about
OL,12,Fpolitical interference in the appeal
OL,13,Fprocess.
OL,15,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch urged
OL,16,FBurnham to publish meetings and
OL,17,Fcontacts related to his work with the
OL,18,Fclub as Greater Manchester mayor.
OL,26,@rD@UOUrD@`O]sD@UOUsD@^O]
