OL,3,CBurnham to publish details of all
OL,4,Cmeetings with scandal-hit Manchester
OL,5,CCity
OL,7,FDowning Street sought to clarify his
OL,8,Fcomments afterwards, saying the PM was
OL,9,Fclear the judgment is serious and that
OL,10,Fwhere wrongdoing is established, those
OL,11,Fresponsible should face the
OL,12,Fconsequences.
OL,14,FBurnham said he would "put out there"
OL,15,Feverything he had done to work with
OL,16,Fthe club's owners as mayor in an
OL,17,Finterview with the Rest is Politics
OL,18,Fpodcast to be released on Monday.
OL,20,FHe said that "the football issues are
OL,21,Fdifferent from the investment issues".
OL,26,@vD@WOUvD@eO]|D@NOU}D@eO]
