OL,3,CBurnham to publish details of all
OL,4,Cmeetings with scandal-hit Manchester
OL,5,CCity
OL,7,FBurnham added: "But I see now people
OL,8,Ftrying to conflate these things. I've
OL,9,Fbeen asked by the leader of the
OL,10,Fopposition to publish details of my
OL,11,Fmeetings, which I'm happy to do.
OL,13,F"I will quite clearly put out there
OL,14,Feverything that I have done working
OL,15,Fwith them in my previous role as mayor
OL,16,Fof Greater Manchester.
OL,26,@oD@POUuD@AOU
