CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1793022500
OL,3,CBurnham to publish details of all
OL,4,Cmeetings with scandal-hit Manchester
OL,5,CCity
OL,7,F"None of it is recent, actually, in
OL,8,Fterms of the meetings I had. I only
OL,9,Fhad one significant meeting, actually,
OL,10,Fand that was in 2021. That is right
OL,11,Fand I will put that all out there.
OL,13,F"But the football issues, they are
OL,14,Fserious and have to be dealt with, and
OL,15,Fthe process is independent and it has
OL,16,Fto run its course. But I think
OL,17,Feverybody should separate the
OL,18,Finvestment issues because they're not
OL,19,Fthe same thing."
