OL,3,CBurnham to publish details of all
OL,4,Cmeetings with scandal-hit Manchester
OL,5,CCity
OL,7,FThe Premier League said an independent
OL,8,Fcommission found City arranged "sham"
OL,9,Fcommercial deals with a number of
OL,10,Ftheir sponsors during the period,
OL,11,Fwhich were part of a disguised funding
OL,12,Fscheme, whereby those companies were
OL,13,Frequired to pay only a portion of the
OL,14,Frelevant sponsorship fees.
OL,16,FThe commission found that the
OL,17,Fremainder was funded by Sheikh Mansour
OL,18,Fbin Zayed Al Nahyan's Abu Dhabi United
OL,19,FGroup Investment & Development Ltd,
OL,20,Fwhich majority-owned the club.
OL,26,@pD@`OUpD@eO]
